{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Invertible matrix","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>方阵（square matrix）<span class=\"math inline\">A\\in\\mathbb F^{n\\times n}</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}</span>，若存在矩阵 <span class=\"math inline\">B</span> 满足 <span class=\"math inline\">AB=BA=I_n</span>，称 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 可逆（invertible），并把唯一的 <span class=\"math inline\">B</span> 记作逆矩阵（inverse matrix）<span class=\"math inline\">A^{-1}</span>。等价地，线性映射 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\mapsto Ax</span> 是双射（bijection）；不可逆方阵也称奇异矩阵（singular matrix）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>映射</td>\n<td>mapping</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵</td>\n<td>matrix</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"la.invertibility.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"la.invertibility","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"可逆矩阵"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Invertible matrix","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>方阵（square matrix）<span class=\"math inline\">A\\in\\mathbb F^{n\\times n}</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}</span>，若存在矩阵 <span class=\"math inline\">B</span> 满足 <span class=\"math inline\">AB=BA=I_n</span>，称 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 可逆（invertible），并把唯一的 <span class=\"math inline\">B</span> 记作逆矩阵（inverse matrix）<span class=\"math inline\">A^{-1}</span>。等价地，线性映射 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\mapsto Ax</span> 是双射（bijection）；不可逆方阵也称奇异矩阵（singular matrix）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>映射</td>\n<td>mapping</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵</td>\n<td>matrix</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"la.invertibility.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"la.invert